## Complete Fleet Status Mapping

When user asks "show me all agents" or "what's the fleet status":

### Full Agent Inventory with Metadata

```bash
# Get all agents with key metadata fields
curl -s "http://127.0.0.1:3100/api/companies/{COMPANY_ID}/agents" \
  | python3 -c "
import sys, json
data = json.load(sys.stdin)
print(f'Total agents: {len(data)}\n')
print(f'{\"#\":<3} {\"Name\":<15} {\"Status\":<10} {\"Adapter\":<18} {\"HB\":<10} {\"ReportsTo\":<12}')
print('-' * 75)
for i, a in enumerate(data, 1):
    name = (a.get('name') or '?')[:14]
    status = (a.get('status') or '?')[:9]
    adapter = (a.get('adapterType') or '?')[:17]
    hb = a.get('lastHeartbeatAt')
    hb = hb[11:16] if hb else '--:--'  # HH:MM
    reports = (a.get('reportsToName') or a.get('reportsTo','?')[:8])[:11]
    print(f'{i:<3} {name:<15} {status:<10} {adapter:<18} {hb:<10} {reports:<12}')
"
```

**Key Status Indicators:**
- `running` = actively processing (heartbeat recent)
